        require(possibleOwner != address(0));

        // Set up: ensure this contract is the owner so that owned() can be called successfully.
        // transferOwnership requires msg.sender == owner, but at deployment of c the deployer is this test's deployer,
        // so transferOwnership will likely revert. Instead, we first try to set owner to this contract by calling
        // transferOwnership from c through a try/catch — this will usually revert unless c.owner==address(this).
        // To get a successful path, call transferOwnership only if current owner equals address(this).

